t has shown consistent weakness by checking on the turn after just calling the flop bet. With only a pair of 5s, this is a marginal hand that's unlikely to improve. However, the opponent's passivity suggests they don't have a strong hand either. A small value bet of 100 can:\n1. Extract value from weaker hands or draws\n2. Deny free cards to flush/straight draws\n3. Not overcommit chips if opponent has me beat\n\nChecking is also reasonable, but given I'm behind overall (-150 chips cumulatively) and need to win pots, applying measured pressure with a small bet seems optimal.\n\nAnswer: 100"}
